#: scenario4:scenario4_15CB16D0_E549_433B_9F2B_A0AE54A1DD91
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6fa3bf5ad5914bbd95d4a5de3619533c6c00477a501e96d12577b78607382fb6
#. default-sha256: aece8fb939915a9f31ae46372a520a44db738774598b9e750d665922b6d1133c
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_15CB16D0_E549_433B_9F2B_A0AE54A1DD91"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫On his way back from the washroom several days later, Michel heard muffled voices."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫少女倒下数日后，⟪k:1⟫从盥洗室折回的米歇尔，⟪k:2⟫听到了外面传来的可疑噪音。"

#: scenario4:scenario4_EA5D1A03_3268_4A54_8101_886DD8F3E0E0
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: fccf03be38439d2209b0795694b51ab1a1e43486056958a4724e256f09ea920b
#. default-sha256: 2d5b379776245a4caa2c6a38945138045d68a58626a3d56b6876a005add913ea
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_EA5D1A03_3268_4A54_8101_886DD8F3E0E0"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫......e⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫......got it?⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫.........ill⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫......im⟪k:8⟫"
"⟪k:9⟫............good..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫……哈啊……⟪k:1⟫都听好了……⟪k:2⟫这里……⟪k:3⟫就……"

#: scenario4:scenario4_6EB564AD_94E5_468B_B345_ED2F871A2E39
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7ce179db1795cd27ab1fe2062deefcef8ca763b77368e0ece4f1686d9f33c373
#. default-sha256: 0f2bb1d9a1df1e399f8e40ccdd472d5c182382f38384770ea8e2279b45b2aab5
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_6EB564AD_94E5_468B_B345_ED2F871A2E39"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫He was having trouble making out what they were saying, but he could tell it was several "
"men, and they were outside the front door."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫大门之外，⟪k:1⟫传来了男人们模糊的声音。⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫这些含糊不清的杂音，⟪k:4⟫听上去不止一个人发"
"出。"

#: scenario4:scenario4_7EC4247B_E5E4_4739_B6F7_7877CE948467
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2bfed1e7b421784fe0bd9aeb54212aa692c3d7db51430aaf35906e352ccc9191
#. default-sha256: 47f4481dfa442b253245d097b135026c380118477b2bc1eb8615e2c9e63e5cb0
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_7EC4247B_E5E4_4739_B6F7_7877CE948467"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The fact that he could hear them at all through the heavy door meant they were probably "
"shouting quite loudly."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫虽说隔门听来声音尚且微弱——⟪k:1⟫但对于那些人来说，⟪k:2⟫可能已经是在大声怒喊着了吧。"

#: scenario4:scenario4_15A7E258_72FE_465C_88F0_C2CB7DEE21F5
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: cf274c7d67e0bbf8354fb19724d93d398c0b6286f4684a612e094874ec8a3395
#. default-sha256: d02989f0a4281aaba62e649af9c739240e481475646ac17d289b90b0d401df39
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_15A7E258_72FE_465C_88F0_C2CB7DEE21F5"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫............"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫…………"

#: scenario4:scenario4_5CEEA977_CD91_4C02_B668_368F8D0B8781
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6518d78c07264e26f130c7878bd2844ffef557a5c9b66cf45159e1184fcd07c6
#. default-sha256: 9ae76ec05d052e6eece4cbc1f89a3e9dd34af1f5ba5626a777e96346e6fca5d4
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_5CEEA977_CD91_4C02_B668_368F8D0B8781"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫An indescribable sense of uneasiness came over him. ⟪k:1⟫Dread. ⟪k:2⟫He drew nearer to the "
"door and focused on the voices on the other side."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫米歇尔的心中，⟪k:1⟫泛起一阵难以名状的不安——⟪k:2⟫这是不祥的预感。⟪k:3⟫他悄悄靠近大门，⟪k:4⟫凑"
"起耳朵聆听起来。"

#: scenario4:scenario4_94A37FCB_0D02_4E7F_831E_711A98040308
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e5165bdee49e0b7b010878c78c34d84ae4379046803592024209a6117e262340
#. default-sha256: 8ae863d51aa93da0be9994465fc9c7c5f4b7cfbdb66df0b5e3f751c15a1b70a5
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_94A37FCB_0D02_4E7F_831E_711A98040308"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫They grew clearer—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫enough for him to make out what the men were saying."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫——⟪k:1⟫外面的声音变得清晰。⟪k:2⟫是的，⟪k:3⟫已经可以听到，⟪k:4⟫外面的男人们说的话的大致意思。"

#: scenario4:scenario4_DE196966_60D1_4F84_A73A_06CABADD72E2
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a9d5870cf9a79f052615c612a9e2abdc4bae3b7304a3393c886cfd43ed517664
#. default-sha256: 0ec260176335ac21dfa7556e710b3d8dc425a8ecc66877a49285d43a82c40093
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_DE196966_60D1_4F84_A73A_06CABADD72E2"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Everything’s in place.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫We’re ready to kill this witch now."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫——做好处死魔女的准备了吧？"

#: scenario4:scenario4_020BB8B6_BA4E_4354_A1E9_8CEC4E825D30
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 68af9b8cdd9250edf19fde12fb451d7126c950e19c16e54d830dfbb20c519d97
#. default-sha256: 9911ce80cc0735aab537b3a5e5c4ea56818b72ac7c5373d092a03aa55894afb4
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_020BB8B6_BA4E_4354_A1E9_8CEC4E825D30"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫This is definitely the place.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫That half-dead bandit said she was in this mansion."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫错不了！⟪k:1⟫就是这个地方……⟪k:2⟫那个濒死的小偷所说的，⟪k:3⟫就是这座屋子！"

#: scenario4:scenario4_F5E94AA9_A9AA_4E9A_A20B_D8B3B8954BB6
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 18290341febff7830c1a3b70fc048b0dbd939a7b49ddbbb4602c42c1ff804ae5
#. default-sha256: c446395986d38532a336a620b03d075fc3c5f99a3703c188c01e0f51f94ca3c9
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_F5E94AA9_A9AA_4E9A_A20B_D8B3B8954BB6"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Listen well. No matter what we find in there, we kill it.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫It could be a child for "
"all I care—⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫that doesn’t change anything."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫都给我听好了，⟪k:1⟫把他们都找出来杀了，⟪k:2⟫就算只是个孩子也别放过！"

#: scenario4:scenario4_D8BD9768_36BB_40C7_BE0E_01A88DBA775F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f4d6066abd0abd7caf543d5f5b6be312cfabae5e758332137a949d8d9f651630
#. default-sha256: 95dda896600964510f809d55b0670cfc0898d0c0adde73dfec2d4d51fcd105f2
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_D8BD9768_36BB_40C7_BE0E_01A88DBA775F"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Kill the witch..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫处死魔女……"

#: scenario4:scenario4_E6DBC15F_E0F2_4941_B4B3_FB7674C65739
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c378e1d8406d555660d9574758452f5a0791645e806b2b37b7d82965cf82f0c3
#. default-sha256: df6707f686450ca2abde6a81a340c5a91b7dcef1d09f68b46f882b06efcc56ab
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_E6DBC15F_E0F2_4941_B4B3_FB7674C65739"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Kill the witch! Kill the witch! Kill the witch!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫处死魔女！⟪k:1⟫处死魔女！⟪k:2⟫处死魔女！"

#: scenario4:scenario4_2CB8A8EE_8568_44A3_ADA7_4EB7FB5ED8F5
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1a69ad112319695a30c3638137d5d0154eb2e86731db448041c751b636f575a2
#. default-sha256: 26a8b967a68217b57afe760a9b49936920a51e747d13965df2397bdf546be9b2
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_2CB8A8EE_8568_44A3_ADA7_4EB7FB5ED8F5"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫—!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫——啧！！"

#: scenario4:scenario4_6E7CDC7B_C369_47C1_BA22_A4E17465AAA1
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: fe5aef872c0420a6c2bb7e3066376285d25e4a397c928bdaee40073c6bff25a9
#. default-sha256: 7174747f355d37cd8b6170e0122a94f9a81441756daf87e76794d0cf78f4c8ca
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_6E7CDC7B_C369_47C1_BA22_A4E17465AAA1"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫What he heard beyond the door was a group of men shouting for the death of the witch."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫耳边震荡着的，⟪k:1⟫是充满了阴暗的吼声。⟪k:2⟫所有的吼声都不约而同地喊出了⟪k:3⟫「处死魔女！」的"
"口号……"

#: scenario4:scenario4_A690B82C_4F7D_4B0F_9AD2_462D3342E8CD
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a61268e1e30955dc2d4e03c39c90499fdd8ed2010c422120698c41fcf04c2607
#. default-sha256: 5d229e7e4a09940834a9f7ffaf7b68a43087bb9e2efe621c53c14681b53de655
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_A690B82C_4F7D_4B0F_9AD2_462D3342E8CD"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫In that moment, Michel regretted his decision to let the bandit go free and not watch over "
"him until the moment of his demise."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫面对这等状况，⟪k:1⟫米歇尔感到了悔恨。⟪k:2⟫因为他那个时候没有亲眼看到暴徒死去。"

#: scenario4:scenario4_3245971D_8FCA_4EC9_8C19_3F353B987522
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 13d8138ac6bef87ac8c2d0ac157b58eb6d1c3c057a143773c5a91d64ed440245
#. default-sha256: 0608f278db3b1f1bb64c38ff11f223fa53b9e211aef3b9a22d531704f574c93d
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_3245971D_8FCA_4EC9_8C19_3F353B987522"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫He must have made his way down to the village in search of help, where he revealed what he "
"had found at the mansion."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫恐怕那个奄奄一息的男子，⟪k:1⟫支撑着跑去村庄寻求救助了吧？⟪k:2⟫继而也把馆里的所见所闻，⟪k:3⟫全"
"都说了出来。"

#: scenario4:scenario4_F047AE0F_CCB8_4BDB_AC49_0FD8AD283747
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e576aa50a59c430194fc6150d27c9b48c481c17e7143de55cebf7c4d3f08e742
#. default-sha256: 78b26e9d1f35694b85c39ed4253d6a4aea1c4001d767579be11c8a5e1ed2aea0
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_F047AE0F_CCB8_4BDB_AC49_0FD8AD283747"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Dammit!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫……该死……！"

#: scenario4:scenario4_54F65A8D_97D4_464B_8D56_5B38582F256D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: fc98bf4ce9bfeb5acd1529accc2dd47367c5d749035fcb8cbe17b1b44da83574
#. default-sha256: 1523cb6fd1e0ea6109012c6e12f8ffaf92a67077c144167c101dfe7d0a13a8d2
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_54F65A8D_97D4_464B_8D56_5B38582F256D"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫But it was too late.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Regret would solve nothing."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫但是——事到如今，⟪k:1⟫一切都为时已晚。"

#: scenario4:scenario4_51142D17_A574_4A28_9DD0_1458CF035845
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5e6be1f79a383038974829cc298a8c06e61a2bcea451bad534d7159f8794208d
#. default-sha256: 19de37da027e863e205dcb877630cd8f604d08246cb7a78abfdb6c7a01319695
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_51142D17_A574_4A28_9DD0_1458CF035845"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫He could neither stop the villagers from raiding the house, nor could he stop the White-"
"Haired Girl from dying to the effects of his curse."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫不管是愤怒的村民们步步紧逼的事——⟪k:1⟫还是少女因为他的「诅咒之血」，⟪k:2⟫而生命垂危的事……"

#: scenario4:scenario4_181FDD0D_E253_466B_A870_811424899C19
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
